/br> le collier</br> le bracelet</br> la bague\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"les lunettes de soleil</br> la montre</br> le sac \u00e0 main</br> l'\u00e9pingle \u00e0 cheveux</br> le parapluie\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Les verbes <span class=\"strong\">SE CAILLER</span> et <span class=\"strong\">PAYER</span>", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Le tableau ci-dessous donne la conjugaison des verbes <span class=\"strong\">se cailler</span> et <span class=\"strong\">payer</span> au pr\u00e9sent de l'indicatif \u00e0 la forme affirmative.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Se cailler</div></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Payer</div></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">je me caille</br>\u2028tu te cailles</br>\u2028il/elle/on se caille</br>\u2028nous nous caillons</br>\u2028vous vous caillez</br>\u2028ils/elles se caillent</div>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\">je paie</br>\u2028tu paies</br>\u2028il/elle/on paie</br>\u2028nous payons</br>\u2028vous payez</br>\u2028ils/elles paient</div>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"content": "frn2le04ob06re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Choisissez un habit.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Imaginez que vous empruntez cet habit \u00e0 votre ami(e).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez un dialogue de six \u00e0 huit lignes avec votre camarade.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez le dialogue \u00e0 hau